PARITY_COVERED=30
(All 23 visible literals resolve from Localizable.xcstrings; key names match the web
 verbatim. The bare rbac.* keys were added with the web English defaults — the
 pre-existing bulk-imported `translation.rbac.*` namespace is left untouched. Beyond
 the required 23, the 5 web rbac.category.* labels were also ported (bare keys +
 rbacCategoryLabel with a raw-id fallback = web `t('rbac.category.{cat}', cat)`), so
 the grid's category group headers render at full fidelity. Zero hardcoded
 user-facing strings — the only Text(verbatim:) calls render either backend data
 (role/permission names + ids) or already-localized + interpolated strings.)

